Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆 我们救了很多人 但救不了所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sam. We save a lot of people, but we just can't save them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:14.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗纳德·雷斯尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald Resnick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是特别探员维克多·亨里克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Special Agent Victor Henricksen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:23.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩，你不会下地狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}dean,you're not gonna go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小可爱们 上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}sic him,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我啊 \N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting pretty slick there,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.59,0:01:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱究竟发生了什么 露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the hell is going on around here,ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:09.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.83,0:01:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}castiello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.73,0:01:13.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是那个紧紧抓住你把你带离地狱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm the one who gripped you tight and raised you from perdition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}i mean  what  are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是侍奉主的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.83,0:01:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么一个天使要救我出地狱呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would an angel rescue me from hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.26,0:01:39.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这是上帝的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}because god commanded it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.23,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们有任务要交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we have work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.83,0:02:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好，我是奥利维亚 我现在不在家 请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey,it's olivia.i'm not in. leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚 我是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}olivia,it's bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到留言之后 给我回个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}call me back,would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这有个大麻烦 我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}i got something big.i could use your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:02:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:19.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:24.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第4季第2集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好 你再告诉我还有什么其他的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,then tell me what else it could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧 就我所知这世上根本就没有天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}look,all i know is i was not groped by an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 想想 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay,look,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你凭什么觉得这个卡西迪奥要对你说谎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}why do you think this castiello would lie to you about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.09,0:03:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他就是某种恶魔 恶魔就会说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe he's some kind of demon. demons lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:50.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个恶魔会不怕盐圈和陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}a demon who's immune to salt rounds and devil's traps...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及露比的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ruby's knife?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩 就算是莉莉丝也害怕这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}dean,lilith is scared of that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想想如果那真的是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you think that if angels were real,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:03:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有哪个猎人在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that some hunter somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾见到过一个天使 或是在哪一刻?\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have seen one... at some point...ever?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 你就有啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah. you just did,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是试图提出这个理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm trying to come up with a theory here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗 跟着我的思路\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay? work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩 这个理论已经存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}dean,we have a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好 那就麻烦不要再神化这件事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,one with a little less fairy dust on it,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:12.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 听着 我不是说我们就确信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay,look. i'm not saying we know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:13.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说我认为我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm just saying that i think we...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好了 这个就是关键点\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay,okay. that's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道该确信什么 所以我根本就不想相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't know for sure,so i'm not gonna believe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么侍奉主的破天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this thing is a freaking angel of the lord
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为他那样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it says so!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个笨蛋是想继续为了宗教信仰吵个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}you two chuckleheads want to keep arguing religion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.62,0:04:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是想到我这儿来看看这个?\N{\fnArial\fs30}or do you want to come take a look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找了大堆相关传说 圣经上的 非圣经上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i got stacks of lore, biblical,pre-biblical.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有那些该死的楔形文字的\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of it's in damn cuneiform.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的都说到了天使可以从地狱中拯救灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}it all says an angel can snatch a soul from the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.27,0:04:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要有什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}what else,what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁能做到做一点?\N{\fnArial\fs30}what else could do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是在钻牛角尖\N{\fnArial\fs30}airlift your ass out of the hot box?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能告诉你的就这么多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as far as i can tell,nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.17,0:04:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩 这是个好消息 怎么说?\N{\fnArial\fs30}dean,this is good news. how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:55.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这一次是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because for once,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次不再是恶魔的另一个谎言了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this isn't just another round of demon crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:04:58.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是 也许你已经被一个好人救了 你明白了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}i mean,maybe you were saved
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好 如果说这是真的 如果说世上真的有天使 \N{\fnArial\fs30}okay. say it's true. say there are angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么 世上真的有个上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}then what? there's a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这一点上 就像是在拉斯维加斯赌大小 信则灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}at this point,vegas money's on yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.47,0:05:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道了 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't know,guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay,look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不是一个信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}i know you're not all choirboy about this stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.65,0:05:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这越来越多的事实成为了那一点点信仰的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is becoming less and less about faith
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而证据却多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and more and more about proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证据? 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}proof? yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证明这个世界上有一个上帝存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}proof that there's a god out there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我却在这里胡扯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}that actually gives a crap about me personally?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 我可不买他的账\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm sorry,but i'm not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.75,0:05:31.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为为什么会是我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}because why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果真的有上帝在这 为什么他为什么要我在这里胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there is a god out there,why would he give a crap about me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 迪恩 - 我的意思是 我也救了很多人 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - I mean,i've saved some people,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要弥补这种偷鸡摸狗的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}i figured that made up for the stealing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.59,0:05:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是为什么我能获得救赎 我是一个普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but why do i deserve to get saved? i'm just a regular guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很明显 你是个正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}apparently,you're a regular guy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点在你脑子里很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's important to the man upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,that creeps me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.73,0:05:53.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不喜欢一个人开生日派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}i mean,i don't like getting singled out at birthday parties,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和...上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}much less by...god.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 这有点麻烦 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay,well,too bad,dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他要你戴好你的生日帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}because i think he wants you to strap on your party hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 对天使我们知道多少?\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right. what do we know about angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}start reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去买点派给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna get me some pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  迪恩 我得先取点钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes,dean,i'll get the chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.73,0:06:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候我忘记过派?\N{\fnArial\fs30}when have i ever forgotten the pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:40.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,all right. bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-露比 -这是真的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}ruby. so,is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么真的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}is what true?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使救了迪恩?\N{\fnArial\fs30}did an angel rescue dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁干的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}who hasn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有100%确定 不过我认为是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not 100% sure,but i think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  再见  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. bye,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa,whoa,whoa,whoa. wait. what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.31,0:07:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  他们可是天使  而我是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,they're angels. I'm a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:15.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可不在乎我是否是良民\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna care if I'm being helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是不分青红皂白的赶尽杀绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}They smite first,and then they ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还知道他们些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从未遇到过  也不想遇到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never met one,and I don't really want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.31,0:07:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所知道的是他们会吓破我的胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that they scare the holy hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己小心  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch yourself,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不怕天使呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not scared of angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别关引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the engine running.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个朋友在另一个州  奥利维亚·罗莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a friend one state over, Olivia Lowry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:56.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使事件发生三天来我都试着和她联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to reach her for three days on this angel thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:07:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忽视了这么多个电话  这可不像她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like her to ignore this many calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚·罗莉  是一个猎鬼者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia Lowry, a hunter,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我们要去看看她  你也一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. we're gonna go check on her. you guys follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:05.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挪旁边点  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scoot over. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.51,0:08:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude? yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:21.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:33.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盐条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚当时正在调试EMF测鬼器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia was rocking the emf meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.12,0:09:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有灵魂在活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spirit activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:10.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  激素调节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, on steroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过鬼把人虐成这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never seen a ghost do this to a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy,you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:20.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近我打电话给了一些猎人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called some hunters nearby...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了  他们可以帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. we can use their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们都没接我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}...except they ain't answering their phones either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:27.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事发生了是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's up,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是杰德  现在不在  请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,this is jed. I'm not around. uh,leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰德  还是迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jed,dean winchester again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.10,0:09:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比·辛格的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend of bobby singer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.87,0:09:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们觉得有事情发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,we think something's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.41,0:09:56.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎人们都出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think it's happening to hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:58.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是想确保你没事  给我回个电话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just want to make sure you're okay. call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他看起来比奥利维亚更糟  你那儿怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks even worse than olivia. what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我检查了卡尔·贝茨和R.C.亚当斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked on carl bates and r.c. adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被面目全非后扔在了床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've redecorated... in red.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:22.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底他妈的怎么回事  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on here,bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:23.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么一群鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did a bunch of ghosts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然想要扳倒猎鬼者呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly want to gank off-duty hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  但在我们所有发现之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know,but until we find out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好呆在我地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys better get your asses to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  萨姆  好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi,sam. it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi,guys. it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  为什么我们没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,how do we survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亨里克森  你不是已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henriksen. Are you... Did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't survive...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:00.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想问的是这个的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's what you're asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你很内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  如果我们知道莉莉丝会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,if we'd known lilith was coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝不会让六个无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't have left half a dozen innocent people
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死在警察局  这只是你的立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that police station to die in your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你却这么做了  这是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this to me. it was your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是随你而来的  我为此付出了代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was after you,and I paid the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.52,0:12:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你让我们留在那儿死去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left us there to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.38,0:14:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  鲍比  快接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it,bobby! pick up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉怎样  看看这是几\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling,huh? how many fingers am I holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,零  我很好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}None. I'll be fine,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:18.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚那是亨里克森吗  对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henriksen? yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  他想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? what did he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:21.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们害他被杀而来报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge 'cause we got him killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  的确是我们害了他  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. well,we did,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  别再讲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:27.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管他妈的到底发生了什么  现在应验在我们身上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the hell is going on,it's happening to us now,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我联系不上鲍比  所以如果你不是在想答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get ahold of bobby,so if you're not thinking answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就啥也别想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:38.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我继续在里面找  你去外面看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go. you check outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:15:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来  无论你是什么  快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out,come out,whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:10.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特  还是这么专横\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean winchester. still so bossy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:14.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不认识我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:19.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才是我的原貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I looked like
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是恶魔剪了我的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before that demon cut off my hair
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还穿的像个荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dressed me like a slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.85,0:16:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:34.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:45.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not demon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:50.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是恶魔附身的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the girl the demon possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格·麦斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴最终能和你聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to finally talk to you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我还没流血致死之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm not,you know,choking on my own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  我还是个高中生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously,I'm just a college girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一天晚上我独自回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was walking home one night
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就被那股黑烟附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And got jumped by all this smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一件你需要明白的事情就是  我是个囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing you know,I'm a prisoner...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在潜意识里是\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时  我是醒着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,I was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不看着她杀死人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to watch while she murdered people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉你把我扔出窗外\N{\fnArial\fs30}So sorry you had me thrown off a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们想  - 不  你们没有想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well,we thought - No,you didn't think!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:47.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在等  在祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept waiting,praying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.18,0:17:49.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被困在里面  向你们呼救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trapped in there screaming at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.81,0:17:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}"just help me,please!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.48,0:17:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是帮助人类的吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to help people,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:55.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么不帮助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:17:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再说抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop saying you're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格  梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg. meg...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只知道毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:20.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想过那个身体里还有个女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever think there was a girl in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.11,0:18:22.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.48,0:18:26.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是控制  杀戮然后烧光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just charged in,slashing and burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:31.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为你们是英雄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're some kind of hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的真对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有想过  被一个正统恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what it's like
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,折磨了几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be ridden for months by pure evil...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:48.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你的家人却束手无策的感受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}...while your family has no idea what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:52.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们尽了最大努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did the best we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你害怕吗  鲍比  我们害怕  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you scared,bobby? we were scared,bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:18:59.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当魔鬼走向我们  把我们紧紧住住\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the monster came for us... and grabbed us tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:02.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们连叫都叫不出来的时候  你却在旁边看着  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we couldn't even scream. you were right there,bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就在房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你离得那么近\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你本可以救我们的  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have saved us nbobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here   bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.23,0:19:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你正好走过那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walked right past nthat door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼抓住我们了  而你却没发现我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monster had us. Nand you didn't find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  他们也不会发现你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now nthey won't find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不仅仅是我  迪恩  我有个妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't just me   dean. Ni had a sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个小妹妹  她很尊重我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little sister. she worshiped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道有个小妹妹是什么感觉的  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how nlittle siblings are   right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们能为你做任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}how they'll do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.53,0:19:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我失踪以后她就跟以前不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was never the same nafter i disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她竟然\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她竟然迷失了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当看到我的尸体躺在太平间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when my body nwas lying in the morgue
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 被打得遍体鳞伤  支离破碎  - 梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat-up   broken... meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.70,0:20:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她干什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}...do you know nwhat that did to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她自杀了  都是因为你  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed herself! Nbecause of you   dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.81,0:20:20.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你想的都是你自己的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because all you were thinking about was your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的复仇  你的魔鬼们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your revenge,and your demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.91,0:20:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们再多说50个拉丁单词  我就能活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 words of latin a little sooner,and I'd still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的小妹妹也能活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My baby sister would still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这比血债得算在你头上  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That blood is on your hands,dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.11,0:20:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.74,0:20:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住  鲍比  我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on,bobby! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:54.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:21.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.71,0:21:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的脑子在地狱里被油炸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your brain get french-fried in hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用子弹可射不死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't shoot me with bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.41,0:21:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是射你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not shooting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是铁灯架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来  他们都是我们认识的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,they're all people we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.94,0:21:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是认识  还是些我们没救的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just know. people we couldn't save.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我在梅格身上看到点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,I saw something on meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:49.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她活着的时候有刺青吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she have a tattoo when she was alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.78,0:21:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:54.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她手上有个a-a标记  就象个图标\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like a-a mark on her hand, almost like a brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我也看到过  在亨里克森身上  - 象什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a mark,too,on henriksen. what did it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:22:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纸  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,paper? thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.31,0:22:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前可能看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have seen this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.78,0:22:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to move. whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.51,0:22:19.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 跟着我  - 好  上哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me. okay. where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.51,0:22:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全的地方  两个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some place safe,you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.51,0:23:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  这里是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby,is this
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实心铁墙  完全裹上了盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solid iron. completely coated in salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,百分百防鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}100% ghost-proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你铸造了个避难所?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You built a panic room?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我周末闲着没事嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a weekend off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.21,0:23:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 鲍比  - 怎么了 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby. what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.81,0:23:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真伟大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.94,0:24:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我不愿意追随上帝的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}See,this is why I can't get behind god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.78,0:24:03.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.28,0:24:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他不存在  也就算了  坏事总是发生在好人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he doesn't exist,fine. bad crap happens to good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.74,0:24:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.34,0:24:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有什么规律或原因  就是胡乱的  恐怖的魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no rhyme or reason, just random,horrible,evil...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.34,0:24:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了  我能体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it,okay. I can roll with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.21,0:24:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果他不在  那他是干什么吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he is out there,what's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当所有这些好人正被撕成碎片的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is he while all these decent people
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝他爷爷的到底在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are getting torn to shreds?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.74,0:24:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死得就剩他一个了  他怎么活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he live with himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他不出手帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,why doesn't he help?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.44,0:24:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有用十英尺的杆子来碰这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't touching this one with at 10-foot pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.68,0:24:32.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.41,0:24:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 找到了  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it. what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.81,0:24:38.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看到的标记  在鬼身上的图标  - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The symbol you saw. - The brand on the ghosts... yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.78,0:24:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔印的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark of the witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.04,0:24:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证据? 什么证据?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness? witness to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.81,0:24:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不同寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}The unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.11,0:24:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们没一个是正常死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them died what you'd call ordinary deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.04,0:24:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看那些鬼魂 它们被强制唤醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}See,these ghosts. They were forced to rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.64,0:24:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们从痛苦中觉醒  更像是一群疯狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They woke up in agony. they were like rabid dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是它们的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.28,0:24:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有人故意这么做的  -谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone rose them... on purpose. who?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.01,0:25:01.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看上去像知道的人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.41,0:25:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那个家伙的法术是如此的强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whoever it was used a spell so powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.91,0:25:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在每一个灵魂上都烙上了印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}It left a mark,a brand on their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.31,0:25:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是谁干的 这里面肯定有阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did this had big plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.18,0:25:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫做 魔印的召唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called "the rising of the witnesses."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.34,0:25:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是古代的预言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It figures into an ancient prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:19.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.51,0:25:20.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这预言是哪本书里的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What... what book is that prophecy from?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.91,0:25:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是广泛出版的译本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,the widely distributed version's
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.78,0:25:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给游客看的 你应该明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for tourists,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.94,0:25:28.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长话短说 这是个新发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}But long story short, revelations.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.01,0:25:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个征兆 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a sign,boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.04,0:25:37.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么征兆?\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sign of what? a sign of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.51,0:25:44.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:58.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.01,0:26:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启? 启示录?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse,apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.58,0:26:03.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四死亡骑士? 瘟疫?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The four horsemen,pestilence?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.35,0:26:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,5美元一加仑的汽油?\N{\fnArial\fs30}$5-a-gallon-gas apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.39,0:26:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.35,0:26:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔印的召唤是个里程碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rise of the witnesses is a mile marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.65,0:26:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那现在我们该干嘛?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so,what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.34,0:26:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公路旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Road trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.87,0:26:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去体验下《大峡谷》 《星舰迷航》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grand canyon,star trek experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.34,0:26:20.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兔八哥农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunny ranch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.14,0:26:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.70,0:26:25.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-去救下我们的朋友如何?-好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we survive our friends out there? great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.74,0:26:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有什么办法在世界末日前离开这个鬼地方?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ideas aside from staying in this room until judgment day?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.14,0:26:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一个符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a spell
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.24,0:26:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能防止征兆的发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}To send the witnesses back to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.70,0:26:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干不干?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should work...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.97,0:26:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  这太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should. great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.37,0:26:39.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我翻译的正确的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}...if I translate it correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.40,0:26:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这屋里有我们所需要的一切东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got everything we need here at the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.77,0:26:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有机会搞到在这屋里的东西吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance you got everything we need here in this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.17,0:26:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你突然觉得我们的好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you thought our luck was gonna start now
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.37,0:26:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在才开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:52.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,符咒要围绕在明火旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spell's got to be cast over an open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.20,0:26:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,书房的壁炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fireplace in the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.54,0:26:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.10,0:26:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不仅仅是个吸引人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just not as appealing
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.47,0:27:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,避难所吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a ghost-proof panic room,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.60,0:27:15.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,互相掩护 给我瞄的准点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover each other. and aim careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.40,0:27:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我完成之前不要把弹药耗完 否则等着它们撕碎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't run out of ammo until I'm done,or they'll shred you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.67,0:27:21.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.24,0:28:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 迪恩 还记得我吗? \N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,dean. you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.57,0:28:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都给我趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody on the floor now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.30,0:28:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有一双激光眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got the laser eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.37,0:28:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗纳德  那个激光眼是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald,huh? with the laser eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.67,0:28:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望对你说见到你真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could say it's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.07,0:28:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你 我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am dead because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.74,0:28:23.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你应该是来帮我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.27,0:28:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想开枪就开吧 别说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna shoot,shoot. don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.60,0:28:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去楼上的衣橱里把红色文件箱拿下来 挺沉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs,linen closet, red hex box. it'll be heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.30,0:28:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.10,0:28:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.94,0:29:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在厨房抽屉里的餐具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitchen. cutlery drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.47,0:29:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个夹层\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a false bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.57,0:29:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒药 鸦片还有蒿草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hemlock,opium,wormwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.90,0:29:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-鸦片? -快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Opium? go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.24,0:29:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.87,0:29:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪物吃掉我们的时候你就走在旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walked right by us while that monster ate us all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.00,0:29:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你本可以救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.30,0:29:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么是离我远点吗 萨姆?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what really pisses me off,sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.37,0:29:58.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见这些个月我是怎么受苦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw how I suffered for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.64,0:30:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你应该学会了很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you must have learned something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.37,0:30:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我为了个所谓的东西而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I died for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.84,0:30:07.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.14,0:30:08.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你和那个叫露比的恶魔在一起干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what you're doing with that demon,ruby...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.04,0:30:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道多少清白的尸体被露比焚烧只为了寻求刺激?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many innocent bodies has ruby burned through for kicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.54,0:30:19.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有有多少女孩子像我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many girls just like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.70,0:30:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却不把她送回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't send her back to hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.74,0:30:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.40,0:30:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩? -鲍比我没事 快点继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? I'm all right,bobby! keep working!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.47,0:30:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.04,0:30:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.70,0:30:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.17,0:30:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.44,0:30:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的死是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.07,0:30:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抛弃了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.30,0:31:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我就听到了爆炸声\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the minute I heard about that explosion,I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.14,0:31:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时就应该明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}"i should have known."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.70,0:31:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have protected you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.50,0:31:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦 还不够快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh-unh. not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.54,0:31:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你的死和莉莉丝的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you left and lilith came
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.84,0:31:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们都死在一片白光闪耀的爆炸中?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we all died in a beautiful blast of...white light?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.27,0:31:22.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.54,0:31:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,45分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.54,0:31:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.14,0:31:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超过45分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.67,0:31:33.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝说她想找点乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith said she wanted to have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:35.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先从你的知己开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The secretary was first.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.44,0:31:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得她么? 那个处女南茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember her? nancy,the virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.37,0:31:42.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉斯把她的肉一片一片切下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith filleted nancy's skin off piece by piece
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.70,0:31:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我们面前  让我们看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right in front of us,made us watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.74,0:31:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-南希一直在尖叫  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy never stopped screaming. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.80,0:31:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.00,0:31:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.50,0:32:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我怎样才能公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how it's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.97,0:32:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人把你从地狱里救出来  我却死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get saved from hell, I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.27,0:32:06.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭什么你有机会重生  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you deserve another chance,dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.40,0:32:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.70,0:32:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.47,0:32:20.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.94,0:32:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗纳德  老兄  我以为我们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald. hey,come on,man. I thought we were pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.30,0:32:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我活着的时候是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I was breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.34,0:32:39.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在想生吃了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm gonna eat you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.40,0:32:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表这样子  我又不是汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...come on,I'm not a cheeseburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.80,0:33:13.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.34,0:34:05.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆!  -掩护鲍比! \N{\fnArial\fs30}-Sam!  -cover bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.17,0:34:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.00,0:34:26.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.84,0:34:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒进壁炉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fireplace!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.37,0:34:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.73,0:35:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要工作总是会有目击人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent job with the witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.75,0:35:50.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些你都知道?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were hip to all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.75,0:35:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was,uh,made aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.38,0:35:56.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢这天使般的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,thanks a lot for the angelic assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.72,0:35:59.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要知道  我心脏差点都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,I almost got my heart ripped out of my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.32,0:36:01.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你还活得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.55,0:36:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为天使会像个监护人一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought angels were supposed to be guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.35,0:36:06.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长着柔软的羽毛  戴着光环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fluffy wings,halos...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.65,0:36:10.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像迈克尔·兰登那样  不是个小混混\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,michael landon. not dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.92,0:36:14.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去读读圣经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read the bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.52,0:36:18.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使是上帝的战士  我是个士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels are warriors of god. I'm a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.62,0:36:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?  那为什么你不战斗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? then,why didn't you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.92,0:36:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来这里不是为了来保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to perch on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.98,0:36:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有更重要的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had larger concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.48,0:36:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使命?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concerns?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.68,0:36:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们在这里被撕成碎片!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were people getting torn to shreds down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.68,0:36:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  当这些惨剧发生的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And,by the way,while all this is going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.85,0:36:35.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝死哪去了  如果有上帝的话?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is your boss,huh,if there is a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.05,0:36:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝的确存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.85,0:36:39.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信 \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.15,0:36:42.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为要是有上帝的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause if there's a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.25,0:36:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他妈的他到底在等什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is he waiting for,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.18,0:36:46.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,种族灭绝?  妖兽四起?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genocide? monsters roaming the earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.05,0:36:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是他妈的世界末日?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The freaking apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.45,0:36:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在什么时候他会晃晃那该死的指头\N{\fnArial\fs30}At what point does he lift a damn finger
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.65,0:36:53.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来帮助那些赖在这里的杂种们?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And help the poor bastards that are stuck down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.42,0:36:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-上帝在施行公义  -如果你说“是以神秘的方式进行“的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}-The lord works  -if you say "mysterious ways,"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.52,0:36:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会揍死你的\N{\fnArial\fs30} so help me,I will kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.15,0:37:07.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在有旁观者这件事上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,bobby was right...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.45,0:37:09.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.82,0:37:12.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一些...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some kind of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.32,0:37:14.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日的征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sign of the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.15,0:37:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们在这里的原因  要出大事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're here. big things afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.58,0:37:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我想知道的事情吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I want to know what kind of things?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.95,0:37:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相当怀疑  但是你需要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sincerely doubt it,but you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.52,0:37:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些复活的目击人是66封印之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rising of the witnesses is one of the 66 seals.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.28,0:37:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我想这该不是海洋世界里的节目吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm guessing that's not a show at seaworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.58,0:37:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些封印被莉莉丝给破坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those seals are being broken by lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.18,0:37:40.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她使了魔咒  她复活了那些目击人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did the spell. she rose the witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.52,0:37:42.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不仅仅是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. and not just here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.85,0:37:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-其他20个猎人都死了  -当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}-20 other hunters are dead.  -of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.25,0:37:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她挑了那些猎鬼者救不了的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She picked victims that the hunters couldn't save
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.35,0:37:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们能在我们周围出没\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that they would barrel right after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.15,0:37:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝有她自己的幽默感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith has a certain sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.98,0:37:54.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就消灭这些鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,we put those spirits back to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.62,0:37:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这无关紧要  封印被破坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter. the seal was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.00,0:38:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么一定要破坏那个封印?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why break the seal anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.07,0:38:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把封印看作门上的锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think of the seals as locks on a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.57,0:38:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢  最后一扇门打开了会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. last one opens and...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.34,0:38:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法就自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer walks free.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.64,0:38:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.44,0:38:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为路西法只是他们说的一个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought lucifer was just a story they told
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.37,0:38:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在恶魔主日学校里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At demon sunday school.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.30,0:38:26.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.74,0:38:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,3天以前  你还以为我不存在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days ago,you thought there was no such thing as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.54,0:38:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想过为什么我们会跟你们合作吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think we're here walking among you now
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.97,0:38:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是2000年以来的第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in 2,000 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.74,0:38:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了阻止路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}To stop lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.37,0:38:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们来这里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.44,0:38:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前的工作就到此为止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well... bang-up job so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.07,0:38:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的主要任务是那些目击人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stellar work with the witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.97,0:38:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.37,0:39:00.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.24,0:39:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他战斗  其他的封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are other battles,other seals.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.17,0:39:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些能赢  有些会输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some we'll win,some we'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.37,0:39:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次我们输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.04,0:39:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的人手是有限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our numbers are not unlimited.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.70,0:39:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这周我失去了6个弟兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six of my brothers died in the field this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.57,0:39:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得天国的敌人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the armies of heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.14,0:39:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是为了攻击你吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should just follow you around?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.64,0:39:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有更大的阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bigger picture here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.90,0:39:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应当对我尊重些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should show me some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.90,0:39:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把你从地狱里拯救了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dragged you out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.90,0:39:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也能再把你送回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can throw you back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.92,0:40:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.35,0:40:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  迪恩?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong,dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.31,0:40:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.31,0:40:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在相信有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no problem believing in...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.28,0:40:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝和天使了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}God and angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.24,0:40:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  还不太信\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.25,0:40:26.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这意味着你相信恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,I guess that means that you believe in the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.13,0:40:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么问我这些?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you asking me all this?
